post_install() {
    cat <<'MSG'
The widget shows nothing until the collector runs:

    systemctl enable --now plasma-nethogsd

Then add the "Plasma NetHogs" widget to a panel or the desktop.

The kernel must have CONFIG_DEBUG_INFO_BTF=y; plasma-nethogsd says so explicitly if
/sys/kernel/btf/vmlinux is missing.
MSG
}

post_upgrade() {
    cat <<'MSG'
plasmashell caches QML, so an already-placed widget keeps the old version until

    systemctl --user restart plasma-plasmashell
MSG
}
